BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315189663@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043137Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T220000
SUMMARY:Game Night @ Archetype West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n\\*\\*This is a collaboration 
 with the Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\\*\\*\n\nBring your favorite game(s)
  or learn a new one – members are always happy to teach! See you there a
 nd have a blast!\n**Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!**\n\nCalling a
 ll dice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers!\nAre 
 weeknights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **Bo
 ard Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**.\n\n**Our Mission:** To ignite laughter\, 
 forge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few friendly rivalrie
 s & battle to the death!\nNo PhD in rulebooks required! Whether you’re a
  Settlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solving ninja\, or your firs
 t time touching a board game ***we will explain all the rules needed.***\n
 \nExpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rolling dice is better with a pint
  in hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: We’re all about fun\, not Ferm
 at’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**: Ticket to Ride routes\, Splend
 or gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n\nFeel free to request any game
  you’d like to play or bring your own. So gather your guild\, stack your
  resource cards\, and let the games begin! May your laughter be loud\, you
 r moves be bold\, and your victory dances be legendary.\n\nSee you at the 
 table!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315189663/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T224655Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T224655Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315257032@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043137Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T150000
SUMMARY:Disc Golf & Board Game Social @ Highland Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n12:00 Disc Golf\, meet at prac
 tice goals by entrance.\n1:00 Board games + drinks inside the main taproom
 .\n\n☀️Come for either activity or stay for both. We’ll have spare d
 iscs available if you want to try disc golf. If you’d like your own\, Hi
 ghland has some and Another Round nearby sells both used and new discs\, p
 lus has practice goals.\n\nFor board games\, feel free to bring your own f
 avorites to share with the group. All skill levels are welcome\, and folks
  are very friendly and welcoming.\n\nEnjoy the sunshine\, good weather\, f
 ood trucks\, and games. Often there is a live band playing in the meadow\,
  a nice bonus for music lovers.\nHope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315257032/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T161936Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T161936Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315334580@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043137Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T210000
SUMMARY:Board Game Night At Diatribe Brewing!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nWelcome to game night at Diatr
 ibe! This is a casual and welcoming event\, no prior board game experience
  required. All skill levels are welcome. If you have games of your own\, p
 lease bring any you'd like to play. Snacks available on-site but also grea
 t take-out options nearby.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315334580/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260619T222300Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260619T222300Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315354579@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043137Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T220000
SUMMARY:Learn to Swing Dance + 2 Hours of Social Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nLet's go to Asheville Swing Ni
 ght on July 10th for an evening of swing dancing\, great music\, and a fun
  beginner-friendly lesson. 💃🕺\n\nThe instructors will kick things of
 f at 7pm with the beginner fundamentals so everyone can learn the basic fo
 otwork and get comfortable with swing dancing. 🎶\n\nNo partner needed. 
 During both the lesson and social dance\, most people rotate partners\, ma
 king it a fun and easy way to meet people and get comfortable in the space
 .\n\n(Most people come alone\, by the way.)\n\n**What dance are we learnin
 g?**\nIntro Lindy Hop and East Coast Swing.\n\n**How many people come?**\n
 Throughout the night there are 55–85 people who usually attend. It's ope
 n to the public\, not just this Meetup group.\n\n**What should I wear?**\n
 Wear shoes that are comfortable to dance in. Heels are not recommended. Le
 ather-soled shoes or comfortable sneakers are best. Dressing up is optiona
 l — people wear everything from casual to vintage-inspired outfits.\n\n*
 *Logistics**\n📍 Location: Haw Creek Commons\nParking is onsite\, or at 
 Haw Creek Elementary if the lot is full. Just walk across the field to the
  venue.\n\n🕖 7:00 PM sharp — Beginner swing dance lesson\n(Please arr
 ive on time\, as the lesson builds progressively and is harder to join lat
 e if you're brand new.)\n\n💃🕺 8:00 PM – 10:30 PM — Social dance 
 with DJ\n\n💵 $10 admission includes both the lesson and dance\nPay at t
 he door (cash or Venmo)\n\n🚪 Doors open at 6:45 PM\n\n👥 Ages 12+\n\n
 **More Info:**\nFacebook Event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/982969894
 324759/\n\nWebsite: [https://ashevilleswingnight.com/](https://ashevillesw
 ingnight.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315354579/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T144214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T144214Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
